# BTK Akademi Datathon 2026

## Task
Regression — predict `career_success_score` (0–100, continuous) for students.
Metric: **MSE** (lower is better). Competition ends June 14, 2026 23:59.

## Key Files
- `data/raw/train.csv` — training data with target
- `data/raw/test.csv` — test data (no target)
- `data/raw/sample_submission.csv` — submission format
- `configs/base_config.yaml` — all hyperparameters and paths
- `src/features/engineering.py` — feature pipeline
- `src/nlp/text_features.py` — sentence-transformer embeddings
- `src/validation/cross_val.py` — 5-fold CV loop
- `src/models/ensemble.py` — ensembling utilities

## Target Variable
`career_success_score` — float, 0–100. Clip all predictions to [0, 100].

## Critical NLP Column
`mentor_feedback_text` — must be embedded via sentence-transformers, not dropped.
Cache embeddings to `outputs/artifacts/embeddings_*.pkl` to avoid recomputation.

## Validation Strategy
Always use 5-fold KFold CV. Report both MSE and RMSE. Never evaluate on the full training set without CV.

## Submission Constraint
Max 5 submissions/day. Always verify submission format matches `sample_submission.csv`.
